Clean-room notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GoREveal is a clean-room implementation. It studies the observable behavior of
prior art in the Go binary reverse-engineering space -- including gore, redress,
GoReSym, GoResolver, gostringungarbler, and AlphaGolang -- and converts that
study into documented findings, corpus fixtures, and differential tests.

No implementation code from those projects is copied, translated, or derived
into this repository. See CONTRIBUTING.md for the clean-room contribution rules
that enforce this boundary.

